      <ul>
      <li>You have an existing OpenShift Container Platform cluster installed on {"{"}{"{"} vmw_short {"}"}{"}"}.</li>
      <li>You have bare-metal hardware with network connectivity to the existing cluster’s machine network.</li>
      <li>
      You have configured the network for the new bare-metal compute machines, including:
      <ul>
