      <li>DNS: Forward and reverse DNS resolution for the new hostnames.</li>
      </ul>
      </li>
      <li>You have obtained the {"{"}{"{"} op_system_first {"}"}{"}"} ISO image that matches your cluster version. You can download this from the <strong>Cluster Details</strong> page on the {"{"}{"{"} hybrid_console {"}"}{"}"} or extract it from the cluster payload.</li>
      </ul>
